{"id":"tigerspite","name":"Tigerspite","type":"Auto Rifle","tier":"Legendary","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/2c48ce32f112ccad3ba09dc67718d6bf.jpg","screenshot":"/common/destiny2_content/screenshots/640114618.jpg","columns":[{"label":"Barrel","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Arrowhead Brake","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8f7fb54687aa52a9c2595d90ce9c9417.png","desc":"Lightly vented barrel.\n  •  Greatly controls recoil\n  •  Increases handling speed"},{"name":"Chambered Compensator","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0b451cbccc7f11f6aec9c153e59474cb.png","desc":"Stable barrel attachment.\n  •  Increases stability\n  •  Moderately controls recoil\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Corkscrew Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7730e1732ed7ef91afce50277639c493.png","desc":"Balanced barrel. \n  •  Slightly increases range and stability\n  •  Slightly increases handling speed"},{"name":"Extended Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9e5e8fa07a84c29252b78b0e7b3106d.png","desc":"Weighty barrel extension.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Decreases handling speed\n  •  Moderately controls recoil"},{"name":"Fluted Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/260eba9dd149dbb94b1306c9ed4dd8db.png","desc":"Ultra-light barrel. \n  •  Greatly increases handling speed\n  •  Slightly increases stability"},{"name":"Full Bore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40a4bdcf0f5a4e492927f9569eaf529d.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for distance.\n  •  Greatly increases range\n  •  Decreases stability\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Hammer-Forged Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/2b9eb6d4489cffc18c10223279198bcc.png","desc":"Durable ranged barrel.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Polygonal Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d7aaccee29cf450d4057a9de871cdc8.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for recoil reduction.\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Smallbore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d1bb6a623f14959a47156ee71acfc3a.png","desc":"Dual strength barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Full Choke","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/629246e67fc8690d56b5478b0262131a.png","desc":"Tightened barrel. Reduces projectile spread when aiming down sights at the cost of precision damage."},{"name":"Rifled Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/79d5f1f469d3290cfb849f4b3e6fc16b.png","desc":"Ranged shotgun barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Greatly decreases handling speed"}]},{"label":"Magazine","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Extended Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/66cfea124e24e73cca1ce6370b44ca7e.png","desc":"This weapon has a greatly increased magazine size, but reloads much slower.\n  •  Greatly increases magazine size\n  •  Greatly decreases reload speed\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness"},{"name":"Alloy Magazine","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/069170916c98748b7b3e33b80bd7d689.png","desc":"Faster reload when the magazine is nearly empty."},{"name":"Appended Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9f468cce26fe35d9db413e2f8451127.png","desc":"This weapon's magazine is built for higher capacity.\n  •  Increases magazine size"},{"name":"Armor-Piercing Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b311ef00478243e21e2a5eec3a59f9d8.png","desc":"Rounds cause extra damage to combatants' shields and overpenetrate targets. \n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"High-Caliber Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d1c49edb2d2b24c74067742c09fd5a5.png","desc":"Shots from this weapon knock the target back farther.\n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Ricochet Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0a494d0442b32aff8c30d8b2b53561bd.png","desc":"Rounds ricochet off hard surfaces. \n  •  Increases stability \n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Flared Magwell","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f95e67e4ff37466505d66d3fa1030782.png","desc":"Optimized for fast reloading.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Greatly increases reload speed"},{"name":"Light Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/736b486ddb80beefacb4f09b5ad016eb.png","desc":"Improved reload and range.\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Accurized Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d85024478504205359c7fb52dbc4f6b6.png","desc":"This weapon can fire longer distances.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Tactical Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f0e309a267b25279a871d182f8910bcc.png","desc":"This weapon has multiple tactical improvements.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases magazine size"},{"name":"Drop Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d19f0c349652f0285bb5f999307b8a1.png","desc":"Increases reload speed but reduces magazine size."},{"name":"Steady Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6c6e1cc341487a8afd0b0c714a229255.png","desc":"This magazine is optimized for recoil control.\n  •  Greatly increases stability \n  •  Slightly decreases range\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness"}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Overflow","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3165fec56b59363fa974a11f5730f4ec.png","desc":"Picking up Special or Heavy ammo automatically loads this weapon beyond normal capacity."},{"name":"Subsistence","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/eaa8f4295a71bf47df7ffd8599f7af4d.png","desc":"Defeating targets partially reloads the magazine from reserves."},{"name":"Outlaw","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/382df469a091c33e190ee583b64923e8.png","desc":"Precision kills greatly decrease reload time."},{"name":"Moving Target","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40b591eae7f122fdf1cfca21fc6f6c0f.png","desc":"Increased movement speed and target acquisition when moving while aiming down sights."},{"name":"Bewildering Burst","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/74c6e8d0ff9596e2ea9b45073701b48b.png","desc":"Reloading this weapon after defeating a target causes the next hit to launch a Kinetic projectile that detonates into a disorienting blast."},{"name":"Shoot to Loot","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e8c6e23afe3c4215f0dc0c2941500c28.png","desc":"Shooting an Orb of Power picks it up. Shooting an ammo brick picks it up and automatically reloads all of your equipped weapons from reserves."},{"name":"Stopping Power","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6ba4277159a85ca73c7da32fa8967527.png","desc":"This weapon's Kinetic ordinance can more easily stagger combatants, and grant increased target acquisition and damage against low-health targets."},{"name":"Dynamic Sway Reduction","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/36091de4dd029fb6e6ab95dbc612ff05.png","desc":"Improves accuracy and stability while continuously holding down the trigger."},{"name":"Tap the Trigger","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a7840da2970b4137a333fb187477dfe0.png","desc":"Grants a short period of increased stability and accuracy on initial trigger pull."},{"name":"Triple Tap","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0795f44c0c3611b15428742c67918cd1.png","desc":"Rapidly landing precision hits will return one round to the magazine."},{"name":"High-Impact Reserves","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/33ed859a08f2ccf643a1ac3c7f201966.png","desc":"Rounds at the end of the magazine deal more damage."},{"name":"Ambitious Assassin","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/1f93b49c7f10b1be70083f913a3c5d63.png","desc":"Overflows the magazine based on the number of rapid kills before reloading."},{"name":"Threat Detector","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9611bdbc48aff898193fd5f705c7cf30.png","desc":"Increased reload, stability, and handling when enemies are in close proximity."},{"name":"Mulligan","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8ca9b9caef4c4c5c0c19d3be25be3755.png","desc":"Missing a shot has a chance to return ammo directly to the magazine."},{"name":"Surplus","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a4c054c3547840300b9ce7ef11b7b6fc.png","desc":"Increases handling, reload speed, and stability for each fully charged ability."},{"name":"Kill Clip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0afd4799427004b2d8170ab213a2ef0c.png","desc":"Reloading after a kill grants increased damage."},{"name":"Invisible Hand","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a309822ed9a0f590a4a3279f9f0d89c4.png","desc":"Repeatedly missing targets increases this weapon's stability for a short time. This buff lasts for a short duration after a target is hit."},{"name":"Fragile Focus","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3d2e945cc3d38e88c87ee3e2687b612a.png","desc":"This weapon gains bonus range until your shield is destroyed. The bonus returns once your shield has regenerated to full strength."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Kinetic Tremors","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/300c343e6c33651a74d8a3fe81536146.png","desc":"Sustained kinetic damage to a target emits a shockwave that damages any nearby targets."},{"name":"Kill Clip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0afd4799427004b2d8170ab213a2ef0c.png","desc":"Reloading after a kill grants increased damage."},{"name":"Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/23e06f4ced1b3e6476f342978ff5bb37.png","desc":"Being in combat for an extended time increases damage, handling, and reload for this weapon until you are out of combat."},{"name":"Eye of the Storm","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8f4755f9068959b26b8829641e5725ad.png","desc":"This weapon becomes more accurate and boosts handling as your health gets lower."},{"name":"All-Star","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/719abc9d2ce56aa4daffd87152d4d97d.png","desc":"Collecting ammo loads this weapon from reserves and enhances its damage and reload speed for a duration.\n\nCollecting Heavy ammo grants more time."},{"name":"One for All","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b1bce269c3cd21393131b4f5cffae692.png","desc":"Hitting three separate targets increases damage for a moderate duration."},{"name":"Onslaught","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7e07db21ba2b35751507256e46230616.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon increase its rate of fire."},{"name":"Under Pressure","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ac8ec81cd8139434a4b19e459bd9b8ff.png","desc":"Improved stability and accuracy as the magazine gets lower."},{"name":"Pulse Monitor","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/64642b7455e88ffde77be53ce7cb7c05.png","desc":"Automatically reloads the magazine and improves weapon handling when wounded—even when this weapon is stowed."},{"name":"Quickdraw","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6893bb2c7ec7d13cb0d91ec9dd8b6500.png","desc":"This weapon can be drawn unbelievably fast."},{"name":"Grave Robber","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/043d100167af67d6041719044a033221.png","desc":"Melee final blows or dealing damage with a charged melee reloads this weapon's magazine from reserves."},{"name":"Hip-Fire Grip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b481f0ed53a3ae0b31a370d115a06860.png","desc":"Increases accuracy, stability, and precision hit targeting when firing from the hip."},{"name":"Rangefinder","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/74270d52bec24f1f5f4c987f5f37fce9.png","desc":"Aiming this weapon increases its effective range and zoom magnification. Increased projectile velocity while aiming Rocket Launchers, Grenade Launchers, and Bows."},{"name":"Swashbuckler","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/42631a4aff4432e794529a5a707eba61.png","desc":"This weapon gains increased damage from melee kills and kills with this weapon."},{"name":"Demolitionist","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/da009697110e06b65d6f827b3b6d5f70.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon generate grenade energy. Activating your grenade ability reloads this weapon from reserves."},{"name":"Unrelenting","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/1e5843177c71ae3f2a4770d01a2f3813.png","desc":"Rapidly defeating targets triggers health regeneration. Guardians and powerful combatants count as more than one kill."},{"name":"Attrition Orbs","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c2092fae6ae58ca77a7f9b4434e688ef.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage creates an Orb of Power."}]},{"label":"Origin Trait","weight":0.5,"perks":[{"name":"Advanced Reflexes","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/705d34b04c45fd66f8cecefe1dab8068.png","desc":"Upon taking damage from a target, quickly guard or aim down sights with this weapon to gain bonus damage, handling, and charge rate for a short time."}]}],"notes":["Inspired by @PodvsEnemies Podcast vs Enemies episode 91 (https://open.spotify.com/episode/50NPk7xF3Tt6X3DVucE9jU?si=44d2b7d44a5a4aec) with @CourtProjects and @ImpetusAlways. First-choice PvE pick for add-clear of Minor Spec enemies in end-game content. Tigerspite has fairly middle-of-the-road stats and a more PvP-oriented trait pool but, if you like the subtype then there are a few interesting rolls. As with all precision weapon subtypes, you can start by not worrying too much about recoil direction, so you might as well push out the range with your barrel perk option. Any of the combat effect rounds in the mag perk slot (Armor-Piercing, High-Caliber or Ricochet Rounds) will add a tiny bit more range and utility in a firefight. In the first trait slot as the support perk, Subsistence really is the best (maybe only) trait that works for PvE while Frenzy is easy to proc and adds +15% damage, and 100 Handling and Reload, once it's procced. The Advanced Reflexes origin trait is quite useful in PvE - when activated by an enemy hit, it adds +30 Handling for additional ready and ADS speed, together with a handy +20 Mobility, for 7.5s. Recommended MW: Range or Stability, with a damage boosting (Minor or Taken Spec) mod. Tags: PvE, PvE-MinorSpec, PvE-EndGame, PvE-God, M+KB, Controller","Inspired by @PodvsEnemies Podcast vs Enemies episode 91 (https://open.spotify.com/episode/50NPk7xF3Tt6X3DVucE9jU?si=44d2b7d44a5a4aec) with @CourtProjects and @ImpetusAlways. Backup PvE pick for add-clear of Minor Spec enemies in general content. Tigerspite has fairly middle-of-the-road stats and a more PvP-oriented trait pool but, if you like the subtype then there are a few interesting rolls. As with all precision weapon subtypes, you can start by not worrying too much about recoil direction, so you might as well push out the range with your barrel perk option. Any of the combat effect rounds in the mag perk slot (Armor-Piercing, High-Caliber or Ricochet Rounds) will add a tiny bit more range and utility in a firefight. In the first trait slot as the support perk, Subsistence really is the best (maybe only) trait that works for PvE while, if you have space in your Vault, you could tuck away one with Kinetic Tremors or Attrition Orbs in the second column, in case they ever get a little love. The Advanced Reflexes origin trait is quite useful in PvE - when activated by an enemy hit, it adds +30 Handling for additional ready and ADS speed, together with a handy +20 Mobility, for 7.5s. Recommended MW: Range or Stability, with a damage boosting (Minor or Taken Spec) mod. Tags: PvE, PvE-MinorSpec, M+KB, Controller","pandapaxxy (PvE / M+KB / Controller): \"Tigerspite is one of those guns that despite not having the best perks, the best stats, or even the best model; something about it feels phenomenal. I enjoy almost every Tigerspite I use, and I am excited to get more of them. Kinetic Tremors, Frenzy, or Kill Clip will depend on your activity and favorite damage boost. Pair it with your favorite reload or reload bypassing perk and you’ve got a dependable workhorse auto that just feels like bliss.\" Recommended MW: Handling.","pandapaxxy (PvP / M+KB / Controller): \"Tigerspite now has a better glow-up for PvP. Fragile Focus is great for starting an engagement but will quickly lose its value the longer you’re in a gunfight. Moving Target is neutrally good for providing a better strafe speed and some much needed aim assist. I prefer Kill Clip in the final column to lower my TtK requirements in subsequent kills, but if you’re going to take this into Trials or 3v3 game modes, Eye of the Storm might be better for its consistency duel to duel.\" Recommened MW: Range.","[YeezyGT's S16] [MW: Stability] \"Tigerspite's great. Now with access to Overflow/Subsistence/Surplus and Frenzy (or even Swashbuckler), its a very strong 450RPM. It's fairly stable, and while I highly recommend Arrowhead for the recoil control, I imagine you can get by without it due to the lower fire rate. Not many 450RPMs feel as good as Tigerspite - it's worth holding onto.\" tags:pve","Inspired by Destiny Massive Breakdowns Podcast 219. PvP/PvE first choice roll. Recommended MW: Stability. Perk set not great for PvE.","Inspired by Destiny Massive Breakdowns Podcast 219. PvE first choice roll. Recommended MW: Stability.","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: controller,god-pve)","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: controller,god-pvp)","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: god-pvp)","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: controller,pve)","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: controller,pvp)","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: pvp)","Chevy's S15 Super Pog PvE Loot List. Recommended MW - Reload/Range"],"estimated":null,"modes":{"all":{"rolls":[[0,14,25,43],[2,14,24,43],[2,14,25,43],[4,14,24,43],[4,15,23,53],[4,16,23,53],[8,16,23,53],[8,16,37,53],[0,14,23,43],[0,14,24,43],[2,14,23,43],[4,16,23,55],[8,15,23,42],[8,16,23,42],[8,16,23,55],[8,16,37,55],[0,13,25,42],[0,13,25,43],[0,14,23,54],[0,14,24,54],[0,14,25,42],[0,14,25,54],[0,16,23,53],[0,16,23,54],[0,16,24,54],[0,16,37,53],[0,16,37,54],[0,17,25,43],[2,13,25,42],[2,13,25,43],[2,14,23,54],[2,14,24,54],[2,14,25,42],[2,14,25,54],[2,16,24,43],[2,17,25,43],[4,14,23,43],[4,14,23,54],[4,14,24,54],[4,14,25,43],[4,14,25,54],[4,15,23,42],[4,15,23,55],[4,15,